<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 105 0 R
/E (Our project, Beezy, will support students and self-directed learners when they need to study, memorize, and review educational topics. We are investigating difficulty with fragmented, overly complicated study applications and the friction of mandatory account sign-ups for simple review sessions. Our proposed solution will help by providing a cozy, app platform that streamlines flashcard creation, self-paced review, and interactive quizzes into an effortless study experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
